    <briefdescription>
<para>This traversal uses the Memory Pool traversal to fixup remaining parent pointers. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This traversal uses the Memory Pool traversal to fixup remaining parent pointers (e.g. declarations that are hidden from the AST traversal). This traversal traverses the whole AST using the memory pool traversal. </para>    </detaileddescription>
